# Copy to secrets.env and fill in your keys.
# secrets.env is gitignored — never commit real values.
#
# Security tips:
# - Prefer this file over putting keys on the command line (shell history).
# - Restrict NTFS permissions on secrets.env to your user account.
# - Rotate keys if a log, screenshot, or PR may have exposed them.
# - See SECURITY.md for vulnerability reporting.
#
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-your-key-here
